@startuml
!theme cyborg
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam defaultFontColor #F3F4F6
title Proposed / illustrative — Candidate short-lived branch and guarded integration flow
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

start
:Start from identified current target revision;
:Create short-lived topic branch if appropriate;
:Commit and actually push through permitted native transport;
:Open revision-bound pull request;
:Evaluate required checks and review policy;
if (Source/target/evidence still current and merge permitted?) then (yes)
 :Guarded native integration into main;
 :Reconcile actual ref outcome and PR metadata;
else (no)
 :Revise / re-evaluate / close without merge;
endif
stop

@enduml